In article <1992Oct27.195145.23016@rs6000.cmp.ilstu.edu>, dbeedle@rs6000.cmp.ilstu.edu (Dave Beedle) writes:
|> 	How does one get past a cockatrice?  I had thought a blind fold
|> might do the trick.  Nope.  Hints?   

If there is a sure fire way, I'm not aware of it.  However, you should
know that if they start to turn you to stone, you can prevent it by 
eating a lizard corpse or praying.  There are many ways to get past 
them:

Solution 1: Hack and Slash

If you have a good weapon, and good armor, you can just walk up to them 
and bash away.  You can usually kill them before they turn you to stone.
I would try to avoid this method if you don't have a lizard corpse handy 
and/or are not in good stead with you god.

Solution 2: Throw things

I think they only can turn you to stone if they hit you or you hit
them.  If you throw things from across the room, or zap wands at them,
you may be able to kill them before they get near you.  This would
probably work better if you're fast or invisible.  I'm not sure if
wands of cancellation have any effect on them.  I doubt it.

Solution 3: Run Away

Works better if you're fast, of course.

Solution 4: Genocide

They wouldn't be the first thing I'd genocide, but if I had a lot
of genocides, I probably would pick them eventually.

